docs {
  # Create Meal Plan
  
  Creates a new meal plan for a date range.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header (Bearer token).
  
  ## Request Body
  - `name` (required): Name of the meal plan (e.g., "Week of Feb 17")
  - `startDate` (required): Start date of the meal plan (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `endDate` (required): End date of the meal plan (YYYY-MM-DD)
  
  ## Response Fields
  - `id` (guid): Meal plan identifier
  - `name` (string): Meal plan name
  - `startDate` (date): Start date
  - `endDate` (date): End date
  - `createdBy` (string): Creator's display name
  - `createdUtc` (datetime): Creation timestamp
  - `recipes` (array): Empty array (no recipes assigned yet)
  
  ## Error Responses
  - `400 Bad Request`: Missing required fields or invalid date range
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or missing authentication token
}
